{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bee Streamer Idler is an overlay for streamers,\u00a0 meant to be used with OBS or StreamLabs Desktop!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use commands to enter and exit the hive and make honey!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Play the demo and support the full release!</strong></i>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This demo will allow you to connect to Twitch.tv, and use the default layout to turn your chatters into bees! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Youtube connection, different skins and more customization options are planned in the main game! Wishlist now!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>List of commands:</i></strong>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >!help (list of commands)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >!exit\u00a0 (exit the beehive)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >!enter (enter the beehive)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >!flip (do a cool flip!)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >!next (forward to the next honey combs)\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Disclaimer:</i></strong>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bee Streamer Idler is integrated with Twitch API, and requires Twitch.tv account to use all of its features! Remember to log in in private, never share your tokens and account details! Game requires a permission to open browser and connect with your Twitch.tv account. Your token will occasionally expire and will require to log in again. This is perfectly normal (one token lasts for around one month). All your data are stored locally on your PC!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4022540?t=1759238404","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4022540?t=1759238404","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022540/2eb59c1150bf88aa50b407abcb5295390c1f43d4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759238404","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022540/2eb59c1150bf88aa50b407abcb5295390c1f43d4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759238404","categories":[{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bee Streamer Idler is an overlay for streamers,\u00a0 meant to be used with OBS or StreamLabs Desktop!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use commands to enter and exit the hive and make honey!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Play the demo and support the full release!</strong></i>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This demo will allow you to connect to Twitch.tv, and use the default layout to turn your chatters into bees! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Youtube connection, different skins and more customization options are planned in the main game! Wishlist now!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>List of commands:</i></strong>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >!help (list of commands)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >!exit\u00a0 (exit the beehive)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >!enter (enter the beehive)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >!flip (do a cool flip!)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >!next (forward to the next honey combs)\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Disclaimer:</i></strong>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bee Streamer Idler is integrated with Twitch API, and requires Twitch.tv account to use all of its features! Remember to log in in private, never share your tokens and account details! Game requires a permission to open browser and connect with your Twitch.tv account. Your token will occasionally expire and will require to log in again. This is perfectly normal (one token lasts for around one month). All your data are stored locally on your PC!</p>","developers":["Aspvera Studio"],"fullgame":{"appid":"4021730","name":"Bee Streamer Idler"},"genres":[{"description":"Animation & Modeling","id":"51"},{"description":"Design & Illustration","id":"53"},{"description":"Utilities","id":"57"},{"description":"Video Production","id":"58"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022540/e9a7691987f7646d7b4e15d63728128392a30693/header.jpg?t=1759238404","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4022540/2035447194/eb162c4b2da88b6df8825a41e3a6eaec2b83890d/1758200872/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758787869","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4022540/2035447194/eb162c4b2da88b6df8825a41e3a6eaec2b83890d/1758200872/dash_h264.mpd?t=1758787869","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4022540/2035447194/eb162c4b2da88b6df8825a41e3a6eaec2b83890d/1758200872/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1758787869","id":257199855,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257199855/movie480.mp4?t=1758787869","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257199855/movie_max.mp4?t=1758787869"},"name":"Bee Streamer Idler Demo Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257199855/dcaadb378accc07adcac602260c10fcd1e5ff6f7/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1758787869","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257199855/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1758787869","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257199855/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1758787869"}}],"name":"Bee Streamer Idler Demo","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5+<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX960+<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</l